 "titulo": "You built a skyscraper on an old lake 🏙️ #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "YOU BUILT IT ON A LAKE",
 "descripcion": "Mexico City sits on soft lake clay. Here is how a tower stays up there, one problem at a time.\n\nWhat should we build next?\n\n#engineering #howitworks #skyscraper #shorts",
 "tags": [
